{"id":"hogar","lemma":"hogar","pos":"noun","rank":780,"glosses":["home","homeland","housekeeping"],"ipa":"/oˈɡaɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"hogares"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-hogar.wav","examples":[{"text":"Éste es nuestro hogar.","en":"We live here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/425166"},{"text":"Miles perdieron sus hogares.","en":"Thousands lost their homes."},{"text":"Bienvenido a nuestro hogar.","en":"Welcome to our home.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453548"},{"text":"Muchos perdieron sus hogares en el terremoto.","en":"Many lost their homes in the earthquake."},{"text":"Mi hogar es tu hogar.","en":"My home is your home.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453906"}]}